{"version":1,"content":"<p>經營48年的旺角樓上書店「樂文書店」今日（28日）宣布，將於今年12月31日或之前結束營業。</p><p>樂文書店表示，經營多年不容易亦有不捨，「不得不說再見」，即日起結業清倉，店內貨品以四五折出售。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.291222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:34:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.849653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.291222+00:00","content_hash":"435a95d95302e41010be9cdfb14809d723e80ae328d3356ea358dc1d5b75af70","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}